REEMENT WITH PROGETTO MAJESTIC S.R.L. TO DEBUT THE FIRST W HOTEL IN TUSCANY', 'text': 'FLORENCE, ITALY, SEPT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH PROGETTO MAJESTIC S.R.L.'}{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2021-09-20 02:00:00', 'title': 'MASTERCARD LAUNCHES GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY INNOVATION LAB', 'text': 'STOCKHOLM--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MASTERCARD LAUNCHES ITS SUSTAINABILITY INNOVATION LAB IN STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN. IT WILL SERVE AS A GLOBAL R&D CENTER FOR SUSTAINABLE DIGITAL PRODUCTS.'}{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2021-09-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'MCCORMICK & COMPANY ANNOUNCED AS GLOBAL COMPACT LEAD', 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD., SEPT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE:MKC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FLAVOR, ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS OFFICIALLY BEEN NAMED A GLOBAL COMPACT LEAD COMPANY BY THE UNITED NATIONS FOR ITS ONGOING COMMITMENT TO THE UN GLOBAL COMPACT AND ITS TEN PRINCIPLES FOR RESPONSIBLE BUSINESS.'}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2021-09-19 07:30:00', 'title': "MERCK'S KEYTRUDA® (PEMBROLIZUMAB) PLUS CHEMOTHERAPY REDUCED RISK OF DEATH BY 27% VERSUS CHEMOTHERAPY AS FIRST-LINE TREATMENT FOR PATIENTS WITH METASTATIC TRIPLE-NEGATIVE BREAST CANCER WHOSE TUMORS EXPRESSED PD-L1 (CPS ≥10)", 'text': 'KENILWORTH, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $MRK #MRK--KEYTRUDA PLUS CHEMO REDUCED RISK OF DEATH BY 27% VERSUS CHEMO AS 1L TREATMENT FOR PATIENTS WITH METASTATIC TNBC WHOSE TUMORS EXPRESSED PD L1 (CPS ≥10)'}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2021-09-18 09:05:00', 'title': "MERCK'S KEYTRUDA® (PEMBROLIZUMAB) DEMONSTRATED SUPERIOR RECURRENCE-FREE SURVIVAL (RFS) IN PATIENTS WITH RESECTED HIGH-RISK STAGE II MELANOMA COMPARED TO PLACEBO IN THE ADJUVANT SETTING", 'text': "KENILWORTH, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $MRK #MRK--MERCK'S KEYTRUDA DEMONSTRATED SUPERIOR RECURRENCE-FREE SURVIVAL IN PATIENTS WITH RESECTED HIGH-RISK STAGE II MELANOMA COMPARED TO PLACEBO"}{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-09-20 09:05:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL 